section Grandioso extends=A1 transpose=2 tempo=152
// the Countess's triumph: A1 a step higher, so the figure sounds at its true pitch
// (D5 E5 F#5 A5 | B5 | E5). Written in C like A1; transpose=2 lifts every new line too
// the band, louder than in A1 (same notes)
